# Office Presence redesign

Source of truth: `docs/design/SPEC.md`, the frame PNGs in `docs/design/frames/`, and `docs/design/prototype.html`.
Before changing a screen, open the matching frame PNG by its frame name (for example `07_P-Today-In.png`) and the SPEC section for it.

## Scope
- This is a UI and information architecture change. Keep existing data fetching, sync, geofence, auth, and API calls working.
- Do not rename or remove existing API endpoints, database columns, or background jobs.
- The only backend addition is correction requests (see `docs/design/corrections-api.md`). Do not build it unless the task says so.
- Change one screen or one component per task. Keep the old screen reachable behind a flag until the new one is reviewed.

## Tokens
- Use tokens only. Web: `docs/design/tokens.css`. Android: `docs/design/android/Color.kt` and `Theme.kt`.
- Never hardcode hex values in components.
- Orange `#FD5108` is only for: the primary action, the points meter bar, the wordmark, selected nav. Text on orange is `#1A1A1A`.
- Green `#2ECC71` only means In or Goal met. Out is neutral grey. No red anywhere.
- No purple, indigo, teal, gradients, glass blur, or decorative shadows. Shadows only on sheets and drawers.

## Language
- Meter and office weight use "points" (SPEC §§19-20): "8 points" target, "5 / 8 points", "Counts as N points" from API. Calendar copy may still say visit day.
- Visit days are informational: "2 visit days". Never "days counted". Never "N more days at ..." hints. Do not show an FYI badge or the word FYI.
- Buttons start with a verb: "Send code", "Check now", "Sync now", "Request a correction", "Approve", "Reject request".
- Use In and Out. Never "checked in".
- No em dash or en dash in any UI string. Use a hyphen, comma, colon, "to", or parentheses.
- Hours are informational (e.g. "Hours today") and never colored, never a progress bar, never a warning. Do not show an FYI badge or the word FYI.

## Navigation
- Android: bottom bar with Today, Month, Colleagues, You. Remove the toolbar overflow menu. Admin console row lives in You, admins only. Developer screen opens by tapping Version 7 times.
- Web: left rail. Employee: My month, Colleagues, Settings. Admin adds Roster, Corrections, Offices, Reports, Rules. `/` sends admins to Roster, others to My month.

## Privacy
- Colleagues see only: In or Out, since when, office name.
- Never show live GPS, coordinates, hours, or points counted to colleagues. Admin review screens show office, times, and phone sync times, never coordinates.

## Done means
- Matches the frame in light and dark.
- Loading, empty, and error states exist where the SPEC lists them.
- No new lint errors, existing tests pass, and strings contain no em or en dash (run `npm run check:dashes` or the grep in SPEC).
